### 0. Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 1. Admin Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "AD0001",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

### 2. Create MATE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/mates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "김민수",
  "nickname": "민수",
  "password": "1234",
  "joinedAt": "2026-08-26"
}

### 3. Create PDA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/pdas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceNumber": 12
}

### 4. Create Area A01 ~ A03
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/locations/areas/range
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alphabet": "A",
  "startNumber": 1,
  "endNumber": 3,
  "width": 2,
  "floor": 1,
  "foodType": "NON_FOOD",
  "nonFoodCategories": ["GENERAL"]
}

### 5. Create Work Type
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/work-types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "재고실사",
  "description": "로케이션별 실재고 확인"
}

### 6. Admin Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard

### 7. Logout Admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout

### 8. MATE Login
# 실제 발급된 MT 사원번호로 수정
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/mate/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceNumber": 12,
  "employeeNo": "MT0001",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 9. MATE Current PDA
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mate/pda-sessions/current

### 10. My Assignments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mate/work-assignments

### 11. Heartbeat example
# POST http://localhost:8080/api/mate/work-sessions/{sessionId}/heartbeat

### 12. Extend Shift
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mate/extension

### 13. End Shift
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mate/shift/end

### 14. Return PDA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mate/pda-sessions/return
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "RETURNED"
}
